&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About our Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;FreedomCare is a healthcare company that has been dedicated to revolutionizing the home care industry since 2016. We support our patients by ensuring they have the power to choose a caregiver who will care for them in the comfort of their own homes. Our mission spans coast to coast, supporting patients across the U.S.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We pride ourselves on our values which drive the level of care that we deliver to our patients:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Here For You (An attitude of service, empathy, and availability)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own It (Drive and ownership)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Do the Right Thing (High integrity)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be Positive (Great attitude and a can-do positive approach to challenges)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join our team and make a positive impact on the lives of others! We are looking for an &lt;strong&gt;Accounts Receivable Specialist II&lt;/strong&gt; for our &lt;strong&gt;Finance Operations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is a remote role with occasional travel into our main office in New York or the FreedomCare hub closest to you. 9AM to 6PM Monday through Friday.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;FreedomCare is looking for an analytical, detail-oriented Accounts Receivable II to join our growing Finance Operations team. This role is focused on Accounts Receivable within a healthcare revenue cycle environment, with some support of billing related activities to help ensure claims, payments, and account balances are processed accurately and efficiently. &lt;strong&gt;Homecare collections experience required.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;In this role, you will help identify and resolve the financial and operational issues that impact how and when FreedomCare gets paid. You will review outstanding balances, research payment discrepancies, investigate claim and account issues, support reconciliations, and work closely with internal teams to resolve problems that affect collections and cash flow.&lt;br&gt;This is a great fit for someone who enjoys working with numbers, solving problems, and digging into the details to understand why an issue occurred. Prior Accounts Receivable or healthcare revenue cycle experience is helpful but not required.&lt;br&gt;Your work will help ensure FreedomCare receives accurate and timely payment, while also helping identify trends, process gaps, and recurring issues that can be improved over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review outstanding Accounts Receivable balances and investigate issues impacting collections and cash flow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research claim, payment, and account discrepancies, including short payments, overpayments, unapplied payments, denials, and reconciliation differences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with payment posting, cash application, account reconciliations, and follow-up on open balances.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review account and payer activity to identify trends, errors, or root causes delaying payment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support billing-related activities as needed to help ensure claims are submitted and processed accurately.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Billing, authorizations, State Operations, and other internal teams to resolve account issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Escalate recurring issues and recommend process improvements to increase accuracy, efficiency, and visibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support reporting, month-end close activities, and other Finance Operations initiatives as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Accounting, Finance, Economics, Business, Mathematics, or another related analytical field preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1–3 years of professional experience in Accounts Receivable, billing, finance, banking, business operations, healthcare operations, customer support, or another analytical role preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Excel or Google Sheets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills, with the ability to research issues and identify root causes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail and good organizational skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple priorities and follow through on open items.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with data, technology, reports, and learning new systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and collaboration skills, with the ability to work well across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity and interest in understanding how financial and operational processes work. We welcome candidates from a variety of analytical backgrounds who are eager to learn, solve problems, and build a career in Finance Operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll Stand Out If You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy digging into account issues and figuring out what caused them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Like working with numbers and using data to make decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience with billing, payment posting, reconciliations, collections, claims, denials, or revenue cycle processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of your work and follow through on commitments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work well in a fast-paced environment and enjoy learning new things.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why work at FreedomCare?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are here for you and committed to providing a best-in-class employee experience. We offer competitive compensation, medical benefits, retirement plans, wellness programs, fun company events and ongoing learning opportunities to grow your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a place where your voice matters, where we build great relationships, and your work has meaning and a tangible positive impact on others!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At FreedomCare, we celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees. We are an Equal Opportunity Employer and do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, ancestry, age, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, citizenship or immigration status, or other applicable legally protected characteristics.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;#INDHV&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;At FreedomCare, base pay is one part of our total compensation package and is determined within a range. This provides our employees with the opportunity to professionally grow and develop within a role. The base pay range for this role is between $45,000 and $65,000 per year at the commencement of your first year of employment. Compensation decisions are dependent upon a variety of factors which may include, but are not limited to: skill set, years of relevant experience, education, location, and licensure/certifications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Compensation Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$45,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$65,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;FreedomCare is a healthcare company that has been dedicated to revolutionizing the home care industry since 2016. We support our patients by ensuring they have the power to choose a caregiver who will care for them in the comfort of their own homes. Our mission spans coast to coast, supporting patients across the U.S.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We pride ourselves on our values which drive the level of care that we deliver to our patients:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Here For You (An attitude of service, empathy, and availability)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own It (Drive and ownership)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Do the Right Thing (High integrity)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be Positive (Great attitude and a can-do positive approach to challenges)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW32020904 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW32020904 BCX0&quot;&gt;Join our team and make a positive impact on the lives of others! We are looking for an &lt;strong&gt;Assistant Manager of Operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW32020904 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;for &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW32020904 BCX0&quot;&gt;our&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW32020904 BCX0&quot;&gt;Wisconsin Team!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role is an on-site position with a required commute of 3 - 5 days per week to our office in Wisconsin.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Department &amp;amp; Position Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot; data-ccp-charstyle-defn=&quot;{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;ac0262f4-8a9e-5820-b908-2d943c5f7113|1&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[201342446,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342447,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;,201342448,&amp;quot;3&amp;quot;,201342449,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469777841,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,201341986,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;24&amp;quot;,469775450,&amp;quot;normaltextrun&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;normaltextrun&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Default Paragraph Font&amp;quot;]}&quot;&gt;The Assistant Manager of Operations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;, Wisconsin&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt; serves as the Agency &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;Administrator and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;is responsible for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt; the performance, daily operations, and continuous improvement of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;FreedomCare’s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt; personal care services in Wisconsin&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt; This role oversees the full client and caregiver lifecycle, from inquiry, sales, intake, and onboarding through service &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;start and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt; ongoing care support, ensuring &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;timely&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt; access, consistent service, and regulatory compliance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;eop&quot; data-ccp-charstyle-defn=&quot;{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;920dbcde-2834-5e15-a5fa-062170b236ba|1&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[201342446,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342447,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;,201342448,&amp;quot;3&amp;quot;,201342449,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469777841,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,201341986,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;24&amp;quot;,469775450,&amp;quot;eop&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;eop&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Default Paragraph Font&amp;quot;]}&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;The Assistant Manager leads people leaders, implements &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;changes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt; partners with operational &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt; and manages staffing, resources, and performance goals. Working with clinical staff, state leadership, and cross-functional partners, this role &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;establishes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt; and maintains compliance&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;with&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;effective processes and uses performance data to improve the client and caregiver experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Every Day You Will:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Drives state-level operational performance across home care sales, intake, orientation, start of care, and ongoing client and caregiver support. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Lead recruiting staff, securing and equipping facilities, establishing referral partnerships, and preparing systems and workflows for service delivery. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Hire, train, coach, and develop Team Leads; establish clear expectations, evaluate performance, and follow up with appropriate action.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Manage lead queues, intake pipelines, documentation collection, eligibility review, authorization status, onboarding readiness, and case aging to support timely enrollment and service activation. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Establish routines for workload distribution, scheduling, attendance, coverage, service levels, escalation review, and capacity planning; support succession planning and leadership continuity. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Monitor and report on conversion, intake completion, activation timeliness, care continuity, quality, productivity, customer experience, compliance, workforce performance, and financial results. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Partner with the Manager of Operations to use dashboards, audits, customer feedback, and operational data to identify trends and root causes; implement corrective actions for delays, errors, staffing gaps, service disruptions, complaints, incidents, and audit findings. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Ensure operations and service delivery follow authorized care plans, payer and program requirements, applicable state and federal regulations, HIPAA, and company policies; coordinate with qualified clinical staff on clinical oversight. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Maintain audit readiness through accurate client, caregiver, and personnel records, service authorizations, visit documentation, qualification and training records, complaint and incident records, and corrective action documentation. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Oversee employee and service provider orientation, ongoing training, evaluations, and competency processes; communicate applicable rules, contractual obligations, and policies and make required reference materials available. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Resolve complex enrollment and care-support escalations and strengthen handoffs among sales, intake, onboarding, clinical, and active-care teams to protect service continuity and customer trust. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Maintain an up-to-date organizational chart and clear lines of authority; designate a qualified Substitute Administrator in writing to maintain operations during the Administrator’s absence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Maintain a safe, adequately equipped office with a working telephone and staffing during business hours; establish written operating hours and inform clients how to access care outside those hours. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Protect the confidentiality and security of physical and electronic client records and ensure required reports and records are accurately maintained and submitted to the appropriate agencies. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Manage competing projects and operational priorities, lead teams through change, and present performance updates, risks, action plans, and recommendations to senior leadership. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ideal Candidate Will Possess:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree or higher in a healthcare-related field from an accredited college; with at least two years of experience working in a healthcare-related field. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;At least five years of operations management experience, including at least one year of supervisory or administrative experience in home health care, personal care, or a related health program. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Training and experience in healthcare administration, and knowledge of applicable state and program requirements, including Wisconsin DHS 105.17 and DHS 107.112 preferred when serving as the Wisconsin Agency Administrator. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Ability to manage a personal care agency, respond to client and caregiver needs, and lead, coach, and develop teams and people leaders. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Ability to manage enrollment and ongoing service workflows, staffing, resources, budgets, and competing priorities while maintaining quality and compliance. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Partner with the Manager of Operations and the National Expansion Program Manager to analyze performance data, identify root causes, resolve operational issues, and implement practical process and technology improvements. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Clear verbal and written communication skills and the ability to build effective relationships with employees, clients, caregivers, referral partners, payers, and regulators. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Sound judgment, attention to detail, and a customer-service approach that balances empathy, timely access, accurate documentation, confidentiality, and regulatory requirements. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
