&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;As a Decision Insights Analyst, you’ll be a core member of our Data Analytics team, responsible for turning data into insight and insight into action.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;This role will work at the intersection of analytics and data science to prepare and structure data, build advanced models, and interpret results with suggested actions to drive impact across our Marketing, Product, Operations, and Workforce teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Every Day You Will:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
