&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Insight Generation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Analyze large, complex datasets to answer key business questions and identify actionable trends &amp;amp; insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Build robust SQL queries, data pipelines, and ad hoc analyses to support cross-functional initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Collaborate with stakeholders to scope projects, structure analyses, and translate findings into clear business recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modeling &amp;amp; Advanced Analytics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Develop predictive models and statistical analyses to forecast key outcomes, supporting decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Apply advanced analytics techniques (e.g., regression, clustering, forecasting) to support workforce planning, marketing optimization, and service design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting &amp;amp; Enablement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Build and maintain dashboards and data tools to democratize access to insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Help ensure data quality, consistency, and governance across the analytics ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Document your work and contribute to team-wide knowledge sharing and best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
