&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Own It (Drive and ownership)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Do the Right Thing (High integrity)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Be Positive (Great attitude and a can-do positive approach to challenges)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join our team and make a positive impact on the lives of others! We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW195190783 BCX0&quot;&gt;Leadership Development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW195190783 BCX0&quot;&gt;Program Manager&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;for our Business Optimization team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role is remote with potential travel to our main office in NY and/or the FreedomCare hub closest to you.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Department &amp;amp; Position Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;FreedomCare&amp;nbsp;is at an inflection point. Our leaders have scaled the organization by navigating ambiguity,&amp;nbsp;operating&amp;nbsp;with limited structure, and collaborating across functions. As&amp;nbsp;FreedomCare&amp;nbsp;continues to grow, we are making a deliberate investment in ensuring&amp;nbsp;our leaders&amp;nbsp;are as&amp;nbsp;capable of scaling the business as they have&amp;nbsp;been&amp;nbsp;building it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:252}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Leadership Development&amp;nbsp;Program Manager&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;will build the enterprise&amp;nbsp;framework&amp;nbsp;that makes this possible. The mandate is not simply to create more training. The&amp;nbsp;initial&amp;nbsp;priority will be to strengthen leadership capability across existing levels, from Team Leads through senior leadership, and&amp;nbsp;embed&amp;nbsp;leadership&amp;nbsp;development&amp;nbsp;across the&amp;nbsp;leader&amp;nbsp;lifecycle, from&amp;nbsp;selection&amp;nbsp;through advancement.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;The broader opportunity is to create an adaptable system that can also support individual contributors preparing to lead for the first&amp;nbsp;time.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;This role will define a&amp;nbsp;practical&amp;nbsp;leadership philosophy&amp;nbsp;rooted in accountability, sound judgment, cross-functional&amp;nbsp;partnership,&amp;nbsp;and operational excellence.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:252}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This is an opportunity for an experienced leadership development professional to build a&amp;nbsp;robust&amp;nbsp;enterprise capability from the ground up.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Success in this role requires earning&amp;nbsp;credibility with senior and operational leaders,&amp;nbsp;translating&amp;nbsp;business&amp;nbsp;priorities&amp;nbsp;into practical leadership&amp;nbsp;solutions that improve performance.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Within the first year, this&amp;nbsp;role&amp;nbsp;will&amp;nbsp;establish&amp;nbsp;the operating system that shapes how leaders are selected,&amp;nbsp;developed,&amp;nbsp;and prepared for&amp;nbsp;greater responsibility across&amp;nbsp;FreedomCare.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities and Scope:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;4&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Own leadership capability strategy and roadmap, translating business priorities into clear&amp;nbsp;ownership, sequenced&amp;nbsp;investments&amp;nbsp;and measurable outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:60,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:252}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
