&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth opportunities:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We offer a supportive environment for professional development and advancement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Enjoy a comprehensive benefits package including&amp;nbsp;competitive compensation, medical benefits, retirement plans, wellness programs, fun company events and ongoing learning opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FreedomCare&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a place where your voice matters, your work has meaning, and your career can thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
